@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR6,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:从位置上来说，<br>诺亚画室里的<br>垃圾滑槽<br>确实很有可能<br>连着焚烧炉……|#0202Trial09_Leia001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR8,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:不，实际上<br>应该就是相连的。|#0202Trial09_Leia002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR3,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:否则，<br>就无法解释为什么<br>诺亚丢掉的纸<br>会出现在焚烧炉里了！|#0202Trial09_Leia003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,Arms,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……不过，<br>到头来【重力】是个大问题。|#0202Trial09_Leia004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,Arms,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:【凶手在连着焚烧炉的<br>垃圾滑槽里往上爬】……<br>|#0202Trial09_Leia005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR5,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:滑槽里<br>根本无处可抓，<br>我们这些<br>柔弱的少女<br>真的能爬得上去吗？|#0202Trial09_Leia006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆皮肉

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:柔弱……？<br>我怎么记得有人力气很大，<br>跟柔弱两个字<br>根本不沾边呢？|#0202Trial09_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR13,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:对啊对啊！<br>还有人<br>可以无视重力<br>飞起来呢！|#0202Trial09_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1,ArmR2,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我可什么都<br>没做哦！？<br>肯定是这个怪力女<br>用四肢支撑身体，<br>从垃圾滑槽里<br>飞速爬了上去！<br>|#0202Trial09_Hanna002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR4,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"你是说【<link=\"Objection_02_02_09_01\">烟囱攀爬法</link>】<br>对吧！|#0202Trial09_Sherry002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"但是<br>这种方法<br>很花时间，<br><link=\"Objection_02_02_09_02\">不太现实</link>呢～|#0202Trial09_Sherry003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR6,ArmL8,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Surprised_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:话说回来，<br>焚烧炉里<br>不是有绳子吗？|#0202Trial09_Sherry004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR15,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Wink_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:用绳子的话，<br>就算在没有抓点的<br>纵向洞穴里<br>也能轻松<br>攀爬吧？|#0202Trial09_Sherry005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR5,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这倒是<br>没错。|#0202Trial09_Leia007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:不过……<br>仅限于从上往下<br>索降的情况。|#0202Trial09_Leia008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我并不是说<br>【很难用绳子爬上去】哦？<br>|#0202Trial09_Leia009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

